OL,5,G2200 Dream Time
OL,6,     FZakia leans into magical sounds,
OL,7,     Fwith Celtic harps, psychedelic
OL,8,     Ffolk and some crackly records.
OL,9,     FPlus, we hear from Welsh New Age
OL,10,     Fmusician Aisha Vaughan.
OL,11,G0000 Ezra Furman's Finest Hour
OL,12,     FEzra Furman sits in, bringing her
OL,13,     Fown unique taste to 6 Music with
OL,14,     Fold favourites and new
OL,15,     Fdiscoveries.
OL,16,G0300 The First Time With David Byrne
OL,17,     FMatt Everitt talks to David Byrne
OL,18,     Fabout high school combos, Talking
OL,19,     FHeads, Brian Eno and beyond.
